    {
      "source": "Provide a <a href=\"HandlerMethodValidationException.Visitor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>Visitor</code></a> to handle <a href=\"../../../validation/method/ParameterValidationResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>ParameterValidationResult</code></a>s\nthrough callback methods organized by controller method parameter type.",
      "translation": "提供一个 `<a href=\"HandlerMethodValidationException.Visitor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>Visitor</code></a>` 来处理通过控制器方法参数类型组织的回调方法的 `<a href=\"../../../validation/method/ParameterValidationResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation.method\"><code>ParameterValidationResult</code></a>`。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"../../ErrorResponseException.html#getStatusCode()\"><code>ErrorResponseException.getStatusCode()</code></a> is 400 for input validation errors, and 500\nfor validation errors on a return value.",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"../../ErrorResponseException.html#getStatusCode()\"><code>ErrorResponseException.getStatusCode()</code></a>` 对于输入验证错误返回 400，对于返回值上的验证错误返回 500。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
