    {
      "source": "The default implementation delegates to <a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageArguments()\"><code>ErrorResponse.getDetailMessageArguments()</code></a>,\nignoring the supplied <code>MessageSource</code> and <code>Locale</code>.",
      "translation": "默认实现委托给<a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageArguments()\"><code>ErrorResponse.getDetailMessageArguments()</code></a>，忽略提供的<code>MessageSource</code>和<code>Locale</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This is useful for example to expand message codes from validation errors.",
      "translation": "这对于例如从验证错误中扩展消息代码很有用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return arguments to use along with a <a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a> to resolve the problem \"detail\" for this exception\nthrough a <a href=\"../../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回要与<a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a>一起使用的参数，以便通过一个<a href=\"../../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>解析此异常的“detail”问题。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Variant of <a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageArguments()\"><code>ErrorResponse.getDetailMessageArguments()</code></a> that uses the given\n<a href=\"../../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a> for resolving the message argument values.",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageArguments()\"><code>ErrorResponse.getDetailMessageArguments()</code></a>` 的变体，使用给定的 `<a href=\"../../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>` 解析消息参数值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return arguments to use along with a <a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a> to resolve the problem \"detail\" for this exception\nthrough a <a href=\"../../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>. The arguments are expanded\ninto placeholders of the message value, for example, \"Invalid content type {0}\".",
      "translation": "返回用于与<a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.html#getDetailMessageCode()\"><code>message code</code></a>一起使用的参数，以通过一个<a href=\"../../../context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>解析此异常的“detail”。这些参数被扩展为消息值的占位符，例如，“Invalid content type {0}\"。",
      "count": 1
    },
